# Split archive parts (tools/split.py) must survive git byte-for-byte: the
# loader in each port's index.html reassembles them and verifies the exact
# byte length before use. Without this, core.autocrlf rewrites the JavaScript
# bundle parts on commit/checkout, and a 20 MB cut that lands between a CR and
# its LF corrupts the merged file.
*.part[0-9] binary
*.part[0-9][0-9] binary
